agraph\"><i><strong>Zay</strong></i> is a quirky school teenager that regrets joining the team but his dog sure doesn\u2019t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Luther</strong></i> is not only a pious priest, he is also a professional gamer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Nyx</strong></i> is an occult enthusiast who\u2019s got her hands on a true to life grimoire.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PURCHASE AND UTILIZE <strong>TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From ancient relics steeped in mystery to state-of-the-art ghost detection devices, equip yourself with these visually captivating tools that seamlessly blend functionality with aesthetic appeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/324f6d3bd847c77b78bd6b55f07ba34a.poster.avif?t=1748911455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/324f6d3bd847c77b78bd6b55f07ba34a.webm?t=1748911455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/324f6d3bd847c77b78bd6b55f07ba34a.mp4?t=1748911455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Gain access to a range of specialized tools to aid you in fulfilling your client requests, such as the Ghost Magnifier, Ritual Bell, Curse Sensor and Flashlight Unit. Use all of them wisely to navigate through the threats and complete the exorcism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE HAUNTED <strong>LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in meticulously designed and atmospheric environments. Discover haunted houses, eerie landscapes, and chilling locations that intensify the sense of fear and anticipation.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/5ed753ede86b7e257cde4ded50cbd284.poster.avif?t=1748911455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/5ed753ede86b7e257cde4ded50cbd284.webm?t=1748911455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/5ed753ede86b7e257cde4ded50cbd284.mp4?t=1748911455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>With limited lights, explore the dark atmosphere as you look for clues to complete your exorcism. Just make sure to be careful of what might be around the corner..</p>",
